{"4188150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Atomic Brain", "steam_appid": 4188150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4215960], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong><i>Atomic Brain</i></strong>— an advanced enterprise of the Soviet industry, where the future has already arrived! Here, in monumental workshops and sterile laboratories, the greatness of the Motherland is forged and ideal robot assistants are created, designed to free the Soviet man from hard work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/dfe7ca3173d04920e3b4c42b23f609e8.poster.avif?t=1787840610\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/dfe7ca3173d04920e3b4c42b23f609e8.webm?t=1787840610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/dfe7ca3173d04920e3b4c42b23f609e8.mp4?t=1787840610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is how our bright tomorrow would have developed peacefully if it hadn't been for the monstrous betrayal. You are an honest state security lieutenant whose loyalty to the oath was trampled on overnight. Some person framed you, falsely accusing you of grand theft and high treason. But on May 8th you got a chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/e81cedc058c5369fb38b26532e1a9e84.poster.avif?t=1787840610\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/e81cedc058c5369fb38b26532e1a9e84.webm?t=1787840610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/e81cedc058c5369fb38b26532e1a9e84.mp4?t=1787840610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A system failure has occurred at the Atomic Brain plant. The mechanical servants of humanity went berserk, wreaked bloody havoc and declared war on their creators. The ideal utopia turned into a steel trap in the blink of an eye. Now only you, armed to the teeth, can get into the very center of this madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/58a04fa4a08c5ce71ad0f7f2d25773a3.poster.avif?t=1787840610\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/58a04fa4a08c5ce71ad0f7f2d25773a3.webm?t=1787840610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/58a04fa4a08c5ce71ad0f7f2d25773a3.mp4?t=1787840610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to break through the hordes of rebellious machines, find the secret Atomic Brain flash drive and upload it to the main terminal in order to turn off the crazed collective intelligence of robots once and for all. Will you be able to survive this mechanical hell, regain your honest name and prevent a catastrophe on a planetary scale? Or will your bones forever remain rusting among the conveyor belts?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/19e58a540211358b158baf58f6c09fd2.avif?t=1787840610\" width=841 height=452 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The atmosphere of Soviet retro-futurism: Walk through the majestic and gloomy locations of the secret facility. Appreciate the aesthetics of monumental architecture and posters from a bygone era, where advanced technology turned against humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/bcd3e75f06fd9f8e55e85e0f37e252cc.poster.avif?t=1787840610\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/bcd3e75f06fd9f8e55e85e0f37e252cc.webm?t=1787840610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/bcd3e75f06fd9f8e55e85e0f37e252cc.mp4?t=1787840610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruthless and spectacular fights: Robots no longer want to help, they want to destroy. Engage in uncompromising and hardcore gunfights where a second's delay costs your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/d3bd773aa21e85592d7523202d85d1bf.poster.avif?t=1787840610\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/d3bd773aa21e85592d7523202d85d1bf.webm?t=1787840610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/d3bd773aa21e85592d7523202d85d1bf.mp4?t=1787840610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly steel opponents: From fast cleaning robots to heavy industrial giants, converted to combat needs. Study their weaknesses and melt metal with accurate shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An uncompromising survival mission: You have no support and no right to make mistakes. Only you, the faithful <strong><u>AK-47</u></strong> and the final terminal, which is waiting for the cherished flash drive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/14bf06c1626908d0132eed5097553146.avif?t=1787840610\" width=560 height=294 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The motherland is looking at you, Lieutenant. It's time to redeem yourself and stop the mechanical apocalypse!</h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong><i>Atomic Brain</i></strong>— an advanced enterprise of the Soviet industry, where the future has already arrived! Here, in monumental workshops and sterile laboratories, the greatness of the Motherland is forged and ideal robot assistants are created, designed to free the Soviet man from hard work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/dfe7ca3173d04920e3b4c42b23f609e8.poster.avif?t=1787840610\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/dfe7ca3173d04920e3b4c42b23f609e8.webm?t=1787840610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/dfe7ca3173d04920e3b4c42b23f609e8.mp4?t=1787840610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is how our bright tomorrow would have developed peacefully if it hadn't been for the monstrous betrayal. You are an honest state security lieutenant whose loyalty to the oath was trampled on overnight. Some person framed you, falsely accusing you of grand theft and high treason. But on May 8th you got a chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/e81cedc058c5369fb38b26532e1a9e84.poster.avif?t=1787840610\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/e81cedc058c5369fb38b26532e1a9e84.webm?t=1787840610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/e81cedc058c5369fb38b26532e1a9e84.mp4?t=1787840610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A system failure has occurred at the Atomic Brain plant. The mechanical servants of humanity went berserk, wreaked bloody havoc and declared war on their creators. The ideal utopia turned into a steel trap in the blink of an eye. Now only you, armed to the teeth, can get into the very center of this madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/58a04fa4a08c5ce71ad0f7f2d25773a3.poster.avif?t=1787840610\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/58a04fa4a08c5ce71ad0f7f2d25773a3.webm?t=1787840610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/58a04fa4a08c5ce71ad0f7f2d25773a3.mp4?t=1787840610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to break through the hordes of rebellious machines, find the secret Atomic Brain flash drive and upload it to the main terminal in order to turn off the crazed collective intelligence of robots once and for all. Will you be able to survive this mechanical hell, regain your honest name and prevent a catastrophe on a planetary scale? Or will your bones forever remain rusting among the conveyor belts?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/19e58a540211358b158baf58f6c09fd2.avif?t=1787840610\" width=841 height=452 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The atmosphere of Soviet retro-futurism: Walk through the majestic and gloomy locations of the secret facility. Appreciate the aesthetics of monumental architecture and posters from a bygone era, where advanced technology turned against humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/bcd3e75f06fd9f8e55e85e0f37e252cc.poster.avif?t=1787840610\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/bcd3e75f06fd9f8e55e85e0f37e252cc.webm?t=1787840610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/bcd3e75f06fd9f8e55e85e0f37e252cc.mp4?t=1787840610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruthless and spectacular fights: Robots no longer want to help, they want to destroy. Engage in uncompromising and hardcore gunfights where a second's delay costs your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/d3bd773aa21e85592d7523202d85d1bf.poster.avif?t=1787840610\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/d3bd773aa21e85592d7523202d85d1bf.webm?t=1787840610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/d3bd773aa21e85592d7523202d85d1bf.mp4?t=1787840610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly steel opponents: From fast cleaning robots to heavy industrial giants, converted to combat needs. Study their weaknesses and melt metal with accurate shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An uncompromising survival mission: You have no support and no right to make mistakes. Only you, the faithful <strong><u>AK-47</u></strong> and the final terminal, which is waiting for the cherished flash drive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/extras/14bf06c1626908d0132eed5097553146.avif?t=1787840610\" width=560 height=294 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The motherland is looking at you, Lieutenant. It's time to redeem yourself and stop the mechanical apocalypse!</h2>", "short_description": "Restore the KGB lieutenant's good name! Fight your way through hordes of rebellious robots at the Atomic Brain factory. Save every bullet, find the coveted flash drive, and disable the machines' insane minds.", "supported_languages": "Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/cc2c4947359f2ca913b4df93f6a233cf99fb8e91/header.jpg?t=1787840610", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/06c6ea57803a7f0d3271c090b06f2f9d5ee837b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787840610", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188150/06c6ea57803a7f0d3271c090b06f2f9d5ee837b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787840610", "website": "https://tepdeb-studio.ru/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4170 or AMD Ryzen 